    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwamutaŋa waIsarela, tiyenu izu damukeŋa dinukuyimbila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami, Mujiki Isarela nadimbuki; hamba kanyamuka nawa cheŋuku. Anamunatili dehi hetuŋa dindi; hikudi wakumuhindwishaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Mwanta Yehova nahoshi nindi, Kumukala kwafuminaŋa ikombakaji dawantu kwakashala nkulakaji hohu, kwafuminaŋa nkulakaji kwakashala ikumi hohu, kudi akwamutaŋa waIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nayili akwamutaŋa waIsarela, nindi, Nkeŋakeŋenu muhandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mukeŋakeŋa kuBeteluku, bayi mwiŋila muGiligaluku, bayi muhita kuBerishebaku; muloŋa akwaGiligali akaya muwukoli chalala, nikuBeteli kwakekala kwamukunkulwayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keŋakeŋenu Yehova muhandi; mukunkulwayi wakayimotokela neyi kesi mwitala daYosefu, kakalashamu, hikwaka mwekana muntu wakakajima muBeteluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwabalumunaŋa wuŋaji, hiwukwikala mutondu walula, mwanataŋa kuloŋa heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukeŋakeŋenu waleŋa tutumbwa Akwakutwa Masaŋu naNyama naKawa, wabalumunaŋa wulelu wakufwa hiwukwikala budidi, wabalumunaŋa mwaana hiwukwiyila nawufuku; watambikaŋa meji amukaluŋalwiji, hakuyiichila hewulu deseki; ijina dindi diyi Yehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waletelaŋa akwaŋovu kujilumuka kwakukasumuka, kulonda kujilumuka kuwani mukala wachipaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahelaŋa woka andaŋa akwawu muchota, atiyaloŋa kumuchima bwi muntu wahoshaŋa yalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi chimudi nakuvidatola atuzweŋi nakuyidiila tidiku yawu yanyilami; chimunatuŋi matala amalola akubalula, himwakashakama mwokuku; munadimi matempa anyivinyu amawahi, himwakanwamu vinyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami neluki nyiloŋa yenu chiyavula, ninshidi jenu chiasweja Ŋovu; mwakabishaŋa ntu aloŋa, mwatambulaŋa maseleka, mwafwopelaŋa atuzweŋi nyiloŋa yawu muchota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi muntu wadihoŋesha kumuchima wakamwena zo-o hamwaka wudi chochochu; muloŋa himwaka watama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keŋakeŋenu yayiwahi, bayi yatamaku, kulonda muhandi; niYehova, Nzambi wamazaza, wakekala nanenu, neyi chimunahoshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helenu yatama, mukeŋi yayiwahi, mukoleshi wuŋaji muchota; wamba kela Yehova Nzambi wamazaza wakayitoŋa akwaYosefu anashali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova, Nzambi wamazaza, Mwanta, nahoshi nindi, Mumalubanza ejima akadila makumbu; munyikwakwa yejima akela nawu, Yayo! Yayo! Akatambika andimi enzi nakudishonashona, akatambika akweti wukalawenu wakudila nyikeŋa enzi nakudila makumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumatempa anyivinyu ejima mwakekala kudila makumbu; muloŋa ami nakahita mukachi kenu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, enu mwakeŋa aŋa ifuku daYehova! Ochu ifuku daYehova mukudikeŋeladi? Himwidima, hichejejuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chidi neyi muntu wukutemuka mutupa hákubulakana nabera; nindi epili mwitala, asachili chikasa chindi kumbaŋu, amusuma nikudi kapela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku daYehova dibuli kwikala mwidima? Indi diikali chejeji? Dibuli kwikala mwidima wasweja, wakadi nihatooka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naheli, nadiwuli yawija yenu, hinukutiya kuwaha nakukumaŋana kwenu kwakudihudikaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalala, hela mukunlambula nyilambu yenu yakushita, ninyilambu yenu yawuŋa, hinukuyitambulaku. Hela nyilambu yenu yakuwunda yawanyama anuna hinakayitala nidisuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fumishenu muyoyu watumina twenu kudami; hinakeŋi kwami kutiya yisanji yenu yidi nakuvumaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiŋa wuŋaji wupwapumukaŋa neyi meji, nikuloŋa kupwapumukaŋa neyi lukaloŋa lweneni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
