              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalala, mwasendelaŋa itenti daMoloki wenu, nimalala awakishi enu akutuŋa, yowu katumbwa kamukishi wenu imwadikoŋeleli. ",
          "type": "text",
